WEBVTT

00:12:58.381 --> 00:13:04.634
Perhapej si nje "crescendo" ne te gjithe boten.

00:13:04.634 --> 00:13:06.486
E kjo qe arsyeja qe Talebanet

00:13:06.486 --> 00:13:10.817
nuk mund t'a toleronin fushaten e saj

00:13:10.817 --> 00:13:13.666
dhe ne 9 Tetor 2012,

00:13:13.666 --> 00:13:19.415
ajo u qellua ne koke 
nga nje distance shume e vogel.

00:13:19.415 --> 00:13:23.560
Ishte fundi i botes 
per familjen time dhe per mua.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:29.379
Bota u shnderrua 
ne nje vrime te madhe te zeze.

00:13:29.379 --> 00:13:31.045
Nderkohe qe vajza ime